		(property "Description" "EXTERNAL POWER GOOD: on while ~PG is low = IN above UVLO and above VBAT (sec 3.12). Kingbright APT2012LVBC/D blue InGaN, 0805. VF 2.2/2.65/3.0 V @ IF=2mA, IF(DC) max 30mA (Spec DSAN8396 Rev V.8B). Only used where the drive rail is +5V_IN -- VF is too high for a 3.3V GPIO."
