		(property "Description" "D6 series R. Pulled from +5V_IN (the MCP73871 IN pin), NOT +VSYS/+3V3: sec 5.2.4 \"The PG output must not be pulled up higher than VIN because there is a diode path back to VIN\" -- an LED from +VSYS would back-feed VIN and glow on battery. (5.0-2.65-0.2)/1k = 2.2mA typ; 1.6mA at VIN 4.75V / VF 3.0V."
