		(property "Description" "D7 series R. GPIO high -> R -> LED -> GND. Sized for <=1.5mA so the GPIO standard drive is enough: (3.2-1.9)/1.2k = 1.1mA typ; 0.7mA worst (VOH 2.9V, VF 2.1V); 1.5mA best (3.3V, VF 1.5V). Assumes nRF9151 GPIO at 3.3V (VIO = +3V3) -- VERIFY against the nRF9151 PS; at 1.8V I/O this LED will not light."
			(at 69.85 110.49 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
