		(property "Description" "D401 series R. BT840 I/O = +3V3. (3.2-1.8)/1.2k = 1.2mA typ, 0.7-1.5mA over spread -- inside nRF52840 standard drive. Blue would be the conventional BLE colour but its 2.65-3.0V VF leaves no headroom on a 3.3V GPIO."
